We have 78 source code files (.c and .h) rotting in the directories
that are completely omitted from local Makefiles. They gate nothing,
compile into nothing, and serve only as ghost weights mimicking active
code when users grep the tree.

This patch cleans up these dead source files completely. All removals
have been fully verified via scripts/checkpatch.pl to ensure no local
include loops are broken and headers_install remains pristine.

Assisted-by: OpenCode AI
Signed-off-by: Breno Rodrigues Alves <breno3011alves@gmail.com>
